# A binding reports the library's ABI version before any other call
# (SPEC.md §13 "abi version"; each binding's version check at step B0).
# A semantic runner reports its core release and protocol version
# instead, and from step B1 (FORMAT.md, Versions, Semantic target).
format 2
id op.library.version
abi 0.1
covers "abi version"
since B0

op library.version
expect ok major=0 minor=1
